# Printing

Routes: `/competitions/:competitionId/reports` (`print.routes.ts`, `print.service.ts`, `@npha/pdf-engine`).

## Flow (Admin Reports)

1. `POST …/preview` → HTML preview + `PrintHistory` `PREVIEW`
2. `POST …/:printId/approve` → `APPROVED` (`print:approve`)
3. `GET …/:printId/download` → PDF (Bearer + blob download in UI)

Permissions: `print:generate` vs `print:approve`. Statuses: `PENDING|PREVIEW|APPROVED|PRINTED|ARCHIVED|FAILED`.

## Rules

- Do not enable Print/Download until the report is **approved** (unless product explicitly changes this).
- Preview HTML must not leak global CSS into the admin shell — render in an **iframe** / `srcDoc`.
- PDF generation stays in `@npha/pdf-engine`; services pass data + branding only.
- Round-scoped reports (round results, launch order) require a selected round.
- Authenticate downloads; never rely on cookie-less `window.open` for PDF/CSV.
